Sorry but what you posted is not your .config file, but the Config.in
file located at the root of Buildroot sources. The file .config really
starts with a dot. If you don't see it, it's because in Unix, files
started with a dot are hidden (you can see then by adding the -a option
to ls, or by properly configuring whatever graphical interface you're
using).

